This project is an independent, zero-dependency, security-hardened context compression
engine, MCP server, HTTP proxy, and interactive Web Studio inspired by the compression
and Compress-Cache-Retrieve (CCR) architecture of headroomlabs-ai/headroom
(https://github.com/headroomlabs-ai/headroom), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
